      {
        "name": "places/ChIJTXvy_YQHBDQRmhHYoCYiUwQ/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21VeGIwSmFXWEJKWDJWRmRYcExhRXRZTnpsVmVsRRAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "5 個月前",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": {
          "text": "細個成日同屋企人食潮州菜\n首先！佢地超好禮貌\n嘢食都好食 特別推介凍烏頭\n起咗骨啖啖肉好正",
          "languageCode": "zh-Hant"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "細個成日同屋企人食潮州菜\n首先！佢地超好禮貌\n嘢食都好食 特別推介凍烏頭\n起咗骨啖啖肉好正",
          "languageCode": "zh-Hant"
        },
        "authorAttribution": {
          "displayName": "Jenny Lee",
